The output of the above Python code will give us the results. The `detected_objects` dictionary contains the results of detecting the objects in the image. The "drawer" (in the detected_labels_list) and the "tv_stand" contain the bounding box coordinates, score, and detected objects in the objects_detection_entries list. The `drawer` label is above the "tv_stand".

